# Vendored V8 headers. They are third-party, they are not read as source here,
# and they move as a block whenever V8 does - sixty-odd files that bury the
# change actually under review. linguist-generated collapses them in pull
# request diffs; linguist-vendored keeps them out of the repository's language
# statistics. Both are display-only: the files are tracked and diffed normally
# by git itself.
#
# Deliberately no text= or eol= rules in this file. This repository has mixed
# line endings and core.autocrlf=false, so adding one would renormalise files
# far outside whatever change introduced it.
dependencies/v8/include/** linguist-generated=true linguist-vendored=true
